{"title":"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution(analytical)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution(analytical)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/4/374ab5d2af59a007e8379035fe73f2caf2105bf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, -x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" /> inside or on the circle of radius <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> centered at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b6a364920ec84c82c57831adffe0e2ad2b9be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/8/0585a504a395a23efc6b237a99f005fccd2b704c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }11\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }12\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }13\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }14\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BeD8xOvfzE0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BeD8xOvfzE0</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything=\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation of the circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/6/2a66ebf5c6b630d8f1c0ded748fc39d003c3af86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-5)^2+(y-5)^2=100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"19\" />. Plugging in the given conditions we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9ef37746a390b6730b8798b01c9bf1303f6255c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-5)^2+(-x-5)^2 \\leq 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"213\" height=\"19\" />. Expanding gives: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/6/c76f44333f4c64feee1973055e2732e5c64308ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-10x+25+x^2+10x+25\\leq 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"291\" height=\"17\" />, which simplifies to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87e47c26a6655a35c0227fd0cc48fbd98cea7c95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2\\leq 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"17\" /> and therefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/b/11bab7141090e3ab7271a1f7c5037c8c1c760969.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\leq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/6/4c6cdfc44a5dac821ba617946e1464827b2f873c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\geq -5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> ranges from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a526e44e36254c196af103613bc724f312b6a209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, for a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/051fbb9faa3823e55d079e9e85172f7ae9dd40d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(A)}\\ 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"29\" /> integer values.\n</p><p>Note by Williamgolly:\nAlternatively, draw out the circle and see that these points must be on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f08809818fd50ee3fc13182a3112bc2bd28dccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"11\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution.28analytical.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution(analytical)\">Solution(analytical)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution(analytical)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Drawing out the diagram, it becomes apparent that all of the successive points are on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f08809818fd50ee3fc13182a3112bc2bd28dccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"11\" />. Since the lowest point of the circle is (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/1/701cd10c3491a05f2048fe002d7f4afc56abf75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-10=-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" />), and the point most to the left is (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/1/701cd10c3491a05f2048fe002d7f4afc56abf75b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-10=-5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />), we see that these <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> points and the origin are collinear, meaning every point in between the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> extreme points of the circle works, inclusive. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/6580ae5b91980178a252655f6a0e7213d2ca7ba4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5 \\le x \\le 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, so counting them or using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa9a0ea200ebebda5c57be2ece528688bede436a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5-(-5)+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/1/051fbb9faa3823e55d079e9e85172f7ae9dd40d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathbf{(A)}\\ 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"29\" /> integer values.\n</p><p>-mrcosmic\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B\">2015 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2015 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017043649\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 231/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4744/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.632      1 -total\n 59.88%    7.564      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 39.15%    4.946      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14059:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017043649 and revision id 268605. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}